{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A beautiful, vibrant pixel afterlife</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/b29c674e53e43730dd3c5d0d6d02ea27.poster.avif?t=1773177942\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/b29c674e53e43730dd3c5d0d6d02ea27.webm?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/b29c674e53e43730dd3c5d0d6d02ea27.mp4?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Welcome to Hell, kid.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The afterlife isn't what you expected.  Sure, you can live forever here, but only if you stay in the good graces of those in power.  And it's looking like you won't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/26e6b54fe292e2904924d6356f8595ea.poster.avif?t=1773177942\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/26e6b54fe292e2904924d6356f8595ea.webm?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/26e6b54fe292e2904924d6356f8595ea.mp4?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you have a Subjugator: a forbidden wrist-worn device that allows you to summon demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/bfbef2bf5cb589085ec5574101d8348c.poster.avif?t=1773177942\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/bfbef2bf5cb589085ec5574101d8348c.webm?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/bfbef2bf5cb589085ec5574101d8348c.mp4?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need it as you explore a vast world full of both charm and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/9b453d9c7afa77f3f9d80b70270ef7ac.poster.avif?t=1773177942\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/9b453d9c7afa77f3f9d80b70270ef7ac.webm?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/9b453d9c7afa77f3f9d80b70270ef7ac.mp4?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique demons to catch and fuse </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party of up to 4 demons at a time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse demons together to get a more powerful species of demon that inherits its parents' spells and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and armor for your demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sidequests to catch legendary demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in English, Japanese, and Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting (English and Spanish)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily inspired by franchises like Shin Megami Tensei and Pokemon, Eternal Exodus has a series of mechanics that, while easy to learn, offer depth and complexity.  Catch demons in the wild, and fuse them with demons in your party to create stronger species of demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through skill inheritance, you can fuse demons to end up with demons who otherwise wouldn't naturally be able to learn the skills you give them.  Want a Clammy that can cast Heal-All?  Simply level up a Whisper to level 8 so it learns it, then fuse the Whisper with a Skullray to get a Clammy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1009410?t=1773177942","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773177942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/9c8413fdc40e3544605448a51fd6c44bcd5335ae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773177942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/9c8413fdc40e3544605448a51fd6c44bcd5335ae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773177942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A beautiful, vibrant pixel afterlife</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/b29c674e53e43730dd3c5d0d6d02ea27.poster.avif?t=1773177942\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/b29c674e53e43730dd3c5d0d6d02ea27.webm?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/b29c674e53e43730dd3c5d0d6d02ea27.mp4?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Welcome to Hell, kid.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The afterlife isn't what you expected.  Sure, you can live forever here, but only if you stay in the good graces of those in power.  And it's looking like you won't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/26e6b54fe292e2904924d6356f8595ea.poster.avif?t=1773177942\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/26e6b54fe292e2904924d6356f8595ea.webm?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/26e6b54fe292e2904924d6356f8595ea.mp4?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luckily, you have a Subjugator: a forbidden wrist-worn device that allows you to summon demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/bfbef2bf5cb589085ec5574101d8348c.poster.avif?t=1773177942\" width=480 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/bfbef2bf5cb589085ec5574101d8348c.webm?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/bfbef2bf5cb589085ec5574101d8348c.mp4?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need it as you explore a vast world full of both charm and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/9b453d9c7afa77f3f9d80b70270ef7ac.poster.avif?t=1773177942\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/9b453d9c7afa77f3f9d80b70270ef7ac.webm?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/extras/9b453d9c7afa77f3f9d80b70270ef7ac.mp4?t=1773177942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique demons to catch and fuse </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party of up to 4 demons at a time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse demons together to get a more powerful species of demon that inherits its parents' spells and skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and armor for your demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sidequests to catch legendary demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in English, Japanese, and Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice acting (English and Spanish)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavily inspired by franchises like Shin Megami Tensei and Pokemon, Eternal Exodus has a series of mechanics that, while easy to learn, offer depth and complexity.  Catch demons in the wild, and fuse them with demons in your party to create stronger species of demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through skill inheritance, you can fuse demons to end up with demons who otherwise wouldn't naturally be able to learn the skills you give them.  Want a Clammy that can cast Heal-All?  Simply level up a Whisper to level 8 so it learns it, then fuse the Whisper with a Skullray to get a Clammy.</p>","developers":["Fordesoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1009410/d898214c1b2ec9794ff21742989e1836ebd7f32e/header.jpg?t=1773177942","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Fordesoft, LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.0 GHz dual-core processor or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video card with 64 MB or more<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.0 GHz dual-core processor or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video card with 64 MB or more<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Eternal Exodus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.0 GHz dual-core processor or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video card with 64 MB or more<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Fordesoft"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u0